                <pb facs="0138" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg42"/>

                <p rendition="#center">To the Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. P. Root</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of the
                        United States of America to Chili:</hi></p>
                <p>The United States legation to the Argentine Republic responds with great
                    satisfaction to the congratulations of the United States legation in Chili, and
                    joins in the prayer that the completion of the transandine telegraph may be the
                    beginning of a bright era of peace and prosperity to the two great republics of
                    South America.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DEXTER E. CLAPP.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
